# Package boundaries

## `@stream-kit/ui`

App-agnostic Svelte primitives. **Do not** import from `packages/app`, `$lib`, SvelteKit routes, app stores, app i18n, or Tauri. Keep exports theme-token based; the app supplies Tailwind tokens.

## Plugins

| Import from | For |
| --- | --- |
| `@stream-kit/plugin` | Types (`Plugin`, `PluginAppApi`, `HandlerDefinitionProps`, …) — prefer `import type` |
| `@stream-kit/core` | Runtime helpers (`getFieldValue` patterns, interpolate, conditions) |
| `@stream-kit/ui/<subpath>` | Shared UI components |

Do not import other first-party plugin packages as hard dependencies for cross-plugin features — use `app.plugins.get` / `tryGet` helpers.

## First-party `$lib` alias

Vite may resolve `$lib` → `packages/app/src/lib` for monorepo plugins (`create-vite-build-config.js`). Treat that as **monorepo-only**. Prefer `@stream-kit/ui` or plugin-local code for anything that should stay portable; don’t grow new `$lib` couplings for shared UI.

## App

Do not import plugin packages into `packages/app` source. Plugins load at runtime via the plugin host / manifests.
